# Portfolio UI

- Keep section anchors aligned with nav (`home`, `about`, `experience`, `projects`, `intel`, `contact`).
- Reuse existing motion/section components; avoid new card systems unless interaction requires it.
- Locale switching goes through `LocaleProvider` / locale context — persist key `portfolio-locale`.
- Images/assets: prefer `public/`; update SEO in `src/app/layout.tsx` when branding changes.
